  "file": "25-lil-light-sketches.jpg",
  "title": "Lil Light sketches",
  "series": "Product design",
  "note": "Reading or writing on a couch or in bed means constantly fighting the light. Lil Light is a small object made to clip on and throw directed light exactly where you need it. The first sketch was rejected for lack of practicality."
 },
 {
  "file": "26-lil-light-drawings.jpg",
  "title": "Lil Light drawings",
  "series": "Product design",
  "note": "A clip-on book light small enough to disappear into your pocket: cast aluminium body, powered by a Type-C charger. It clips where you need it and puts the light entirely in your hands. Small object, strong idea."
 },
